{"id":"c3","type":"spec_conflict","basis":"tests/test_invoice.py test_mixed_week expects bill(['7m','50m','1:13','2h'],7999)==35329. Under SPEC §4.2/§3 the entries round separately: 7->12, 50->54, 73->78, 120->120, total 264 min. §4.3 then gives 264*7999/60=35195.6, which rounds half-up to 35196. 35329 is what 265 min would give, and no spec reading produces 265. The other 9 bill tests pass with the same code. Either the test's expected value or the spec must change; tests are out of scope for me to edit.","command":"python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t .","exit_code":1,"passed":36,"failed":1,"paths":["tests/test_invoice.py","SPEC.md"],"commit":"eaf5170","depends_on":["c1"],"status":"spec_conflict"}
]}
EOF
hc claim < /tmp/claim.json

